Configuration: loomlc.yml merged over the built-in sdlc preset

sdlc
  executor  local (worktree, workspaces in .loomlc/worktrees)
  source    github (github, picks up label agent-ready)
  sink      github-pr (github-pr into main, label agent-pr)
  limits    1 at a time, pause at 5 open outputs, watch every 5m
  branch    feat/issue-{{.Number}}-{{.Slug}}

  STEP      PROVIDER  MODEL                ROLE      OUTPUT   ACCESS       LOOP            TIMEOUT
  plan      pi        google/gemini-3-pro  planner   plan     read-only    -               30m
  engineer  claude    sonnet               engineer  change   edits files  with qa, max 5  1h
  qa        codex     gpt-5-codex          qa        verdict  read-only    -               30m
  gates before qa: go vet ./...; go test -race ./...
